{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">下月25日是中秋節，康文署會由下月17日起一連十一日在維園足球場舉行綵燈會，免費入場。旅發局同一時段亦在維園內舉行「國際中秋綵燈匯」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">每晚亮燈時間是6時半至11時，中秋節正日當晚會延長至午夜12時。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TOURISM-1630.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026In2kdVrKXj1787832164.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TOURISM-1630.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">綵燈匯展出包括國家級非遺的南京秦淮綵燈，並由當地設計團隊製作的8米高大榕樹燈組。亦有雲集20個國家的世界綵燈大街，多組巨型荷花及象徵圓滿吉祥的錦鯉等中秋主題綵燈。及由逾400盞玉兔、楊桃等手紮花燈打造而成的綵燈庭。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TOURISM-1630_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026roFp67w5D81787832217.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TOURISM-1630_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T12:19:52.412651+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}